Academics
1. GET http://localhost:5000/api/academics
2. GET http://localhost:5000/api/academics/semester-results
3. GET http://localhost:5000/api/academics/cgpa-history
4. GET http://localhost:5000/api/academics/backlogs
5. POST http://localhost:5000/api/academics/semester/1/subject
{
  "subjectCode": "MCA101",
  "subjectName": "Data Structures",
  "credits": 4,
  "category": "Core",
  "cia1": 18,
  "cia2": 19,
  "cia3": 20,
  "mse": 25,
  "ese": 55,
  "obtainedMarks": 92,
  "maxMarks": 100,
  "attendance": 95,
  "grade": "O"
}
6. POST http://localhost:5000/api/academics/semester/1
7. GET http://localhost:5000/api/academics/analytics
8. PUT http://localhost:5000/academics/semester/1/subject/{subjectId} (update)
9. DELETE http://localhost:5000/academics/semester/1/subject/{subjectId} (delete)
10. PUT http://localhost:5000/academics/semester/1
11. GET http://localhost:5000/academics/cgpa-history
12. POST http://localhost:5000/academics/semester/1/lock